{
    "title": "Lanetalk",
    "description": "A GROUNDBREAKING TOOL FOR BOWLERS\r\nDo as the PBA Pro\u2019s Jason Belmonte and Kyle Troup \u2013 use the LaneTalk app during Practice and Competition to gain key insights to improve your bowling!\r\n\r\nLaneTalk automatically track your scores, giving you all your games and stats into your phone \u2013 without manual entry. Gather and analyze your progress over time, compare with friends and opponents or join our popular and fun online tournaments to compete with players from around the world. \r\n\r\nTRUSTED STATS - AS SEEN ON TV\r\nLaneTalk is the official PBA and USBC stats supplier. Now you can get the same stats from your practice, league play or other competitions. Follow the action during all big bowling events and get real-time updates thru our Live Scoring features or compare your favorite bowlers\u2019 side-by-side.  \r\n\r\nBECOME A BETTER BOWLER\r\nOur app will track your scores and help you to analyze your play. Deep dive into your detailed score cards or get advanced statistics as the app reads every frame you play and presents aggregated stats from all your games. Compare your stats with competitors or Pro\u2019s to improve your weaknesses and continue to build on your strengths. \r\n\r\nNEW! COMPARE BALL PERFORMANCE AND OIL PATTERN\r\nWe\u2019re revolutionizing bowling. Again. We\u2019re now introducing Lanetalk PRO, a subscription that allows you to compare your balls\u2019 performance over time as well as their stats on different oil patterns. Try one month for free!\r\n\r\nALWAYS A COMPETITION TO JOIN\r\nNo matter when you are visiting the bowling center, there\u2019s always a leaderboard to master. You can challenge friends and bowlers around the world and take part in online challenges. Be a local champion or conquer the worldwide leaderboards! Do you have the nerves, or do you chicken out?\r\n\r\nCONNECT TO THE GLOBAL BOWLING COMMUNITY\r\nFollow and keep track of friends and stars and invite them to follow you and your games. Share your success with your friends. Join local, regional and global challenges or invite your friends for a fun competition. Download the app today and join the growing online community!\r\n\r\nFEATURES AT-A-GLANCE:\r\n\u2022 Join free and exclusive tournaments\r\n\u2022 Automatic score tracking \r\n\u2022 Get Strike, Spare and Split stats from all your games\r\n\u2022 Your most common Pin leaves and advanced in-depth analytics\r\n\u2022 Digital Score Cards and a personal statistics archive\r\n\u2022 Live Scoring from thousands of centers and bowling events\r\n\u2022 Join Online Tournaments & Competitions \r\n\u2022 Challenge friends and conquer local and global Leaderboards\r\n\u2022 Follow friends, competitors and Pro\u2019s and compare your stats\r\n\u2022 Share your scores and brag about your results\r\n\u2022 Optimize your game with performance data for your balls\r\n\u2022 Tag ball, condition and oil pattern for every game\r\n\u2022 The first global handicap system\r\n\r\nLearn more at Lanetalk.com\r\n\r\nGET YOUR CENTER CONNECTED\r\nAsk your home center to visit Lanetalk.com to learn more about how to create a free center account. When connected, all scores will automatically be sent to the LaneTalk platform. Download the LaneTalk app, create an account and start tracking your scores to your profile to get endless data and stats to develop your play. It\u2019s free for both Centers and Bowlers to join.",
    "descriptionHTML": "A GROUNDBREAKING TOOL FOR BOWLERS<br>Do as the PBA Pro\u2019s Jason Belmonte and Kyle Troup \u2013 use the LaneTalk app during Practice and Competition to gain key insights to improve your bowling!<br><br>LaneTalk automatically track your scores, giving you all your games and stats into your phone \u2013 without manual entry. Gather and analyze your progress over time, compare with friends and opponents or join our popular and fun online tournaments to compete with players from around the world. <br><br>TRUSTED STATS - AS SEEN ON TV<br>LaneTalk is the official PBA and USBC stats supplier. Now you can get the same stats from your practice, league play or other competitions. Follow the action during all big bowling events and get real-time updates thru our Live Scoring features or compare your favorite bowlers\u2019 side-by-side.  <br><br>BECOME A BETTER BOWLER<br>Our app will track your scores and help you to analyze your play. Deep dive into your detailed score cards or get advanced statistics as the app reads every frame you play and presents aggregated stats from all your games. Compare your stats with competitors or Pro\u2019s to improve your weaknesses and continue to build on your strengths. <br><br>NEW! COMPARE BALL PERFORMANCE AND OIL PATTERN<br>We\u2019re revolutionizing bowling. Again. We\u2019re now introducing Lanetalk PRO, a subscription that allows you to compare your balls\u2019 performance over time as well as their stats on different oil patterns. Try one month for free!<br><br>ALWAYS A COMPETITION TO JOIN<br>No matter when you are visiting the bowling center, there\u2019s always a leaderboard to master. You can challenge friends and bowlers around the world and take part in online challenges. Be a local champion or conquer the worldwide leaderboards! Do you have the nerves, or do you chicken out?<br><br>CONNECT TO THE GLOBAL BOWLING COMMUNITY<br>Follow and keep track of friends and stars and invite them to follow you and your games. Share your success with your friends. Join local, regional and global challenges or invite your friends for a fun competition. Download the app today and join the growing online community!<br><br>FEATURES AT-A-GLANCE:<br>\u2022 Join free and exclusive tournaments<br>\u2022 Automatic score tracking <br>\u2022 Get Strike, Spare and Split stats from all your games<br>\u2022 Your most common Pin leaves and advanced in-depth analytics<br>\u2022 Digital Score Cards and a personal statistics archive<br>\u2022 Live Scoring from thousands of centers and bowling events<br>\u2022 Join Online Tournaments &amp; Competitions <br>\u2022 Challenge friends and conquer local and global Leaderboards<br>\u2022 Follow friends, competitors and Pro\u2019s and compare your stats<br>\u2022 Share your scores and brag about your results<br>\u2022 Optimize your game with performance data for your balls<br>\u2022 Tag ball, condition and oil pattern for every game<br>\u2022 The first global handicap system<br><br>Learn more at Lanetalk.com<br><br>GET YOUR CENTER CONNECTED<br>Ask your home center to visit Lanetalk.com to learn more about how to create a free center account. When connected, all scores will automatically be sent to the LaneTalk platform. Download the LaneTalk app, create an account and start tracking your scores to your profile to get endless data and stats to develop your play. It\u2019s free for both Centers and Bowlers to join.",
